MCP Hands-on – Groq Integration
MCP Client - Created mcp_client.py to connect to the MCP server using ClientSession and stdio_client.
Starts the MCP server.
Initializes the MCP session.
Lists the available tools.
Calls an MCP tool.
MCP Inspector - Used MCP Inspector to visually test the MCP server and its available tools.
The Inspector helps verify that the MCP server is running and that its tools are exposed correctly.
Groq Integration - Created groq_mcp.py to connect Groq LLM with the MCP server.
MCP allows an AI application to communicate with external tools in a standardized way.
MCP Server exposes tools.
MCP Client connects to the server and invokes tools.
Groq can decide which MCP tool to use based on the user's request.
Successfully implemented Groq → MCP Client → MCP Server → Tool execution.